<title>MOLDOVA: MOLDOVA 28-,182-DAY T-BILL YIELDS DOWN, 91-DAY UP.</title>
<headline>MOLDOVA 28-,182-DAY T-BILL YIELDS DOWN, 91-DAY UP.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annualised yield on Moldovan  28-day Treasury bills fell to 21.20 percent on Tuesday from 22.54 percent at the previous auction on November 19, a National Bank official told Reuters.</p>
<p>The yield on 91-day T-bills rose to 27.88 percent annual from 26.51 percent.</p>
<p>Six-month T-bill yields fell to 29.70 percent from 30.23 percent.</p>
<p>Full details of the 28-day T-bill auction:</p>
<p>						 Nov 26	  Nov 19</p>
<p>    Issue volume			   3.00 mln lei  3.00 mln lei</p>
<p>    Denominations			  1,000 lei     1,000 lei</p>
<p>    Nominal demand			 6.01 mln	4.83 mln</p>
<p>    Volume sold			    3.00 mln	3.00 mln</p>
<p>    Yield				    21.20 pct     22.54 pct</p>
<p>    Price				    98.4 pct	98.3 pct</p>
<p>    Range of bids			  98.4-99.0 pct 98.3-98.8pct</p>
<p>    Maturity				 Dec 26, 1996  Dec 19, 1996</p>
